<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 8.145 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ govt Feb 2001 bonds yield 8.145 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday its offer of NZ$100 million of February 2001 bonds yielded an average 8.145 percent.  </p>
<p>Maturity   Coupon   Avg Yield   Range    Offer    Bid   Accepted</p>
<p>Feb 2001   8.0 pct    8.145   8.14-8.15   100     662     100</p>
<p>Settlement date is September 3.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
